    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but \"multi-faceted\" is a bit vague for a policy document. If you had to advise the council on which single principle should be the foundation of the policy to ensure we are actually being \"equitable\" in the way modern urban planning intends, which one would it be? They need a clear direction.",
